      <activity id="bbd45226-013a-5853-aeea-fa293525da0a" activityNameId="f3aa63b9-695e-5ee2-958f-517615490073" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Adhesive for metals, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Adhesive for metals, at plant
Basic materials applied in the production are organic chemicals, liquid epoxy resin, hydrated lime and silica sand. This dataset does not include any energy consumption in the production phase. Road and rail transport are included.;
UUID: 7b67d403-59a8-3578-9a61-c9ac80a950a1
The dataset describes the production of a metal adhesive compound used e.g. in the aluminium window frame production.
Location: Data retrieved from a safety data sheet by a German producer. Applicable for Europe.
Technology: Simple mass balance. No process energy included.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Company information 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: None.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7b67d403-59a8-3578-9a61-c9ac80a950a1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
